{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01RHDr9aq1xapQtKZdtmknoC","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# 2026-04-14-0140-multistream-stacked-reduction-round0\n2\t\n3\tMulti-stream the per-trace sequential loops in Stacked Reduction's Round 0 sumcheck (`batch_sumcheck_uni_round0_poly`) and PLE fold (`fold_ple_evals`). These two functions currently launch ~797 sequential per-trace CUDA kernels on the default stream (22ms block_sum + 8ms final_reduce + 9ms fold_ple = 39ms GPU time, ~45ms wall time including launch overhead). Distributing across 8 OS threads with per-thread CUDA streams — the same pattern that improved Round 0 by 1.89x and GKR input eval by 1.40x — should reduce this to ~8ms wall time, saving ~37ms at APC 300.\n4\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d2e39847-b30b-4a34-8468-d493bf69eac0","uuid":"e9e649fe-f8db-4324-884f-1883f7a7bf59","timestamp":"2026-04-14T00:37:42.908Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/georg/stark-backend/autoopt-results/task.md","content":"# 2026-04-14-0140-multistream-stacked-reduction-round0\n\nMulti-stream the per-trace sequential loops in Stacked Reduction's Round 0 sumcheck (`batch_sumcheck_uni_round0_poly`) and PLE fold (`fold_ple_evals`). These two functions currently launch ~797 sequential per-trace CUDA kernels on the default stream (22ms block_sum + 8ms final_reduce + 9ms fold_ple = 39ms GPU time, ~45ms wall time including launch overhead). Distributing across 8 OS threads with per-thread CUDA streams — the same pattern that improved Round 0 by 1.89x and GKR input eval by 1.40x — should reduce this to ~8ms wall time, saving ~37ms at APC 300.\n","numLines":4,"startLine":1,"totalLines":4}}}
