{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01M8p9QS4nQayBbW9iFq7pu7","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01Cb9Ez1Kpm9SWhMksYeU4r8","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/home/georg/stark-backend/autoopt-results/task.md","content":"# 2026-04-14-0300-precompute-logup-round0-interaction-rules\n\nPre-compute the logup Round 0 interaction evaluation DAG, rules, and weight-index mapping at keygen time, eliminating per-AIR `SymbolicConstraints::from()`, `SymbolicDagBuilder` construction, `SymbolicRulesGpu::new()`, rule encoding, and `d_rules` device upload in `evaluate_round0_interactions_gpu`. The keygen code already builds this identical DAG (pkey.rs:116-142) but discards everything except `buffer_size`. Keeping the full pre-computed rules and a compact weight mapping table allows the hot path to skip all DAG reconstruction and only compute challenge-dependent weights (~0.2ms per AIR instead of ~1.0ms). At APC 300 with 623 AIRs across 8 round-robin-balanced threads, this eliminates ~0.8ms of CPU overhead per AIR, yielding ~50-80ms wall-time improvement for Round 0.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":875,"cache_read_input_tokens":156432,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":875},"output_tokens":40,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d2e39847-b30b-4a34-8468-d493bf69eac0","uuid":"01e1b04e-1100-4c0d-b379-ab45a26eedb4"}
