{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01U1JTrjrxcxVwBQwEzMSNbb","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# 2026-04-14-0300-precompute-logup-round0-interaction-rules\n2\t\n3\tPre-compute the logup Round 0 interaction evaluation DAG, rules, and weight-index mapping at keygen time, eliminating per-AIR `SymbolicConstraints::from()`, `SymbolicDagBuilder` construction, `SymbolicRulesGpu::new()`, rule encoding, and `d_rules` device upload in `evaluate_round0_interactions_gpu`. The keygen code already builds this identical DAG (pkey.rs:116-142) but discards everything except `buffer_size`. Keeping the full pre-computed rules and a compact weight mapping table allows the hot path to skip all DAG reconstruction and only compute challenge-dependent weights (~0.2ms per AIR instead of ~1.0ms). At APC 300 with 623 AIRs across 8 round-robin-balanced threads, this eliminates ~0.8ms of CPU overhead per AIR, yielding ~50-80ms wall-time improvement for Round 0.\n4\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_016kCvratRQRgkxgGjPu12YA","session_id":"d2e39847-b30b-4a34-8468-d493bf69eac0","uuid":"488b6033-58de-4f10-b60a-e7735ad2270e","timestamp":"2026-04-14T01:02:49.264Z"}
