{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01455FSvpat4o5A5irMtrjBY","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01E9pu9Ybkb5Zu5eAJ8xMeeD","name":"Edit","input":{"replace_all":false,"file_path":"/home/georg/stark-backend/autoopt-results/2026-04-14-0300-precompute-logup-round0-interaction-rules/plan.md","old_string":"6. **Memory**: The pre-computed `LogupRound0Rules` stores `d_rules` (on device, one buffer per AIR), `weight_map` (host-side, compact), and `denom_sum_entries` (host-side, compact). For 623 AIRs, the additional device memory is negligible (each AIR's rules are typically <1KB). Host memory for weight_map is ~10 entries × 623 AIRs = ~50KB.","new_string":"6. **Memory**: The pre-computed `LogupRound0Rules` stores `d_rules` (on device, one buffer per AIR) and `weight_map` (host-side, compact). For 623 AIRs, the additional device memory is negligible (each AIR's rules are typically <1KB). Host memory for weight_map is ~10 entries × 623 AIRs = ~50KB."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2123,"cache_read_input_tokens":177724,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2123},"output_tokens":9,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d2e39847-b30b-4a34-8468-d493bf69eac0","uuid":"b93ea33c-ef9a-49a2-bd7c-e007312a8b02"}
